flowchart TD
    ROOT[Offline Root Authority\n2-of-3] --> TARGETS[Top-level Targets\n2-of-3]
    ROOT --> SNAP[Snapshot Key\nProtected Online]
    ROOT --> TS[Timestamp Key\nSeparate Online]

    TARGETS --> REL[splitos-release\nRelease Metadata Key]
    TARGETS --> KNOW[splitos-knowledge\nKnowledge Metadata Key]
    TARGETS --> REC[splitos-recovery\nRecovery Authorization\n2-of-3]

    REL --> REM[Release Metadata / Envelope Targets]
    KNOW --> KPKG[Knowledge Packages]
    REC --> RA[Exact RecoveryAuthorization]

    CODE[Authenticode Code-Signing Key\nNon-exportable HSM / Signing Service] --> PE[SplitOS EXE / DLL / Bootstrap]

    REM --> VERIFY[Client Release Verification]
    KPKG --> VERIFY
    RA --> VERIFY
    SNAP --> VERIFY
    TS --> VERIFY
    PE --> VERIFY

    VERIFY --> APPLY[Staged / Recovery Apply Candidate]
